fu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-zhangfu-ws2413335","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001","quote":"張輔，字世偉，南陽西鄂人，漢河間相衡之後也。少有幹局，與從母兄劉喬齊名。初補藍田令，不為豪強所屈。時強弩將軍龐宗，西州大姓，護軍趙浚，宗婦族也，故僮僕放縱，為百姓所患。輔繩之，殺其二奴，又奪宗田二百餘頃以給貧戶，一縣稱之。轉山陽令，太尉陳准家僮亦暴橫，輔復擊殺之。累遷尚書郎，封宜昌亭侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001:m0017"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本傳具衡為先世，中間世次未詳。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001:m0017","surface":"衡","start":17,"end":18,"person_id":"vzb_fi3_bli","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin060-zhangfu-ancestor","subject_person_id":"i3u_1ry_2bg","object_person_id":"vzb_fi3_bli","predicate":"ancestor","qualifiers":{"source_term":"漢河間相衡之後"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-zhangfu-ws2413335","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001","quote":"張輔，字世偉，南陽西鄂人，漢河間相衡之後也。少有幹局，與從母兄劉喬齊名。初補藍田令，不為豪強所屈。時強弩將軍龐宗，西州大姓，護軍趙浚，宗婦族也，故僮僕放縱，為百姓所患。輔繩之，殺其二奴，又奪宗田二百餘頃以給貧戶，一縣稱之。轉山陽令，太尉陳准家僮亦暴橫，輔復擊殺之。累遷尚書郎，封宜昌亭侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001:m0017"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本傳具衡為先世，中間世次未詳。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-060-zhangfu:p001","text":"張輔，字世偉，南陽西鄂人，漢河間相衡之後也。少有幹局，與從母兄劉喬齊名。初補藍田令，不為